  title: HDRPLabStudio
  sections:
  - heading: Welcome to HDRPLabStudio
    text: 'A free HDRP automotive visualization sample updated for the latest Unity
      HDRP workflow.

      

      Explore the vehicle using the new orbit camera,
      interactive controls, redesigned UI, and HDRP studio environment.'
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: What's New
    text: "\u2022 Unity Input System support\r\n\u2022 New orbit camera system\r\n\u2022
      Redesigned runtime UI\r\n\u2022 Camera switching\r\n\u2022 Door / Hood / Trunk
      controls\r\n\u2022 Headlight controls\r\n\u2022 Updated HDRP studio setup\r\n\u2022
      Reorganized project structure"
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: Controls
    text: "Mouse \u2014 Orbit Camera\r\nSpace \u2014 Handbrake\r\n1\u20134 \u2014
      Doors / Hood / Trunk\r\nL \u2014 Headlights\r\nC \u2014 Next Camera"
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: HDRP Vehicle Studio
    text: A lightweight HDRP environment for automotive visualization, interactive
      vehicle presentation, and real-time configurator prototyping.
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: About HDRPLabStudio
    text: 'HDRPLabStudio focuses on Unity HDRP visualization, rendering, interactive
      systems, and technical R&D.

      

      Thank you for using HDRPLabStudio.'
    linkText: Visit HDRPLabStudio
    url: https://www.youtube.com/@yoon9718
  loadedLayout: 1
